{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15378","headline":"送别驾赴晋陵即舍人叔之兄 · 李端","name":"送别驾赴晋陵即舍人叔之兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诸宗称叔父，从子亦光辉。\n谢脁中书直，王祥别乘归。\n江帆冲雨上，海树隔潮微。\n南阮贫无酒，唯将泪湿衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}